{"id":"78afa700fb","title":"Sv overview","template":"<section class=\"section sv-overview\" aria-labelledby=\"managed-cloud-infrastructure-services-s1\">\n  <div class=\"container sv-overview__grid\">\n    <div class=\"sv-overview__copy\">\n      \n    <div class=\"sv-head\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">{{s0}}</p>\n      <h2 class=\"grad-head\" id=\"managed-cloud-infrastructure-services-s1\">{{s1}}</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n      <div class=\"sv-prose sv-prose--lede\"><p>{{s2}}</p><p>{{s3}}</p><p>{{s4}}</p></div>\n      \n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sv-overview__media\">\n      <figure class=\"media ratio-4-5 sv-overview__photo\">\n    {{i5}}\n  </figure>\n      <p class=\"sv-overview__tag\"><span class=\"sv-overview__tag-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M17.5 19H8a6 6 0 1 1 5.7-7.9A4.5 4.5 0 1 1 17.5 19Z\"/></svg></span><span>{{s6}}<strong>{{s7}}</strong></span></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"sv-included\">\n      <p class=\"sv-included__label\">{{s8}}</p>\n      <ul class=\"sv-ticks\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s9}}</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s10}}</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s11}}</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s12}}</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s13}}</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s14}}</span></li></ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>","uses":1,"slots":[{"k":"s0","type":"s","label":"Label above heading 1","default":"Understanding the problem"},{"k":"s1","type":"s","label":"Heading 1","default":"Cloud infrastructure doesn’t usually fail overnight"},{"k":"s2","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 1","default":"Most organisations gradually add users and cloud services without evolving the infrastructure underneath them. Over time that leads to inconsistent performance, rising costs and security risks that stay hidden until something breaks."},{"k":"s3","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 2","default":"Proactive design, monitoring and optimisation give you an environment that stays reliable, scalable and secure, so your infrastructure supports the business rather than holding it back."},{"k":"s4","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 3","default":"Cloud infrastructure is monitored, patched and maintained continuously, with capacity and cost reviewed rather than left to drift. WhizzIT is Cyber Essentials certified and a Microsoft Cloud Solution Provider, so our security fundamentals are independently assessed rather than simply claimed. It is priced per user at a fixed monthly cost rather than bundled into rigid packages, so it scales with your team. Everything runs through the same UK service desk that handles your day-to-day tickets, so there is no separate team to chase."},{"k":"i5","type":"i","label":"Image 1","default":{"html":"<img src=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-managed-cloud-infrastructure-services-1024.webp\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-managed-cloud-infrastructure-services-640.webp 640w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-managed-cloud-infrastructure-services-1024.webp 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-managed-cloud-infrastructure-services-1600.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 45vw, 100vw\" alt=\"Long data centre corridor lined with glass-fronted server cabinets\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\">","src":"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-managed-cloud-infrastructure-services-1024.webp"}},{"k":"s6","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"Managed Cloud Services"},{"k":"s7","type":"s","label":"Bold text 1","default":"Managed Cloud Infrastructure"},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 5","default":"Common risks we uncover"},{"k":"s9","type":"s","label":"List item 1","default":"Environments struggling to scale with the business"},{"k":"s10","type":"s","label":"List item 2","default":"Single points of failure across critical systems"},{"k":"s11","type":"s","label":"List item 3","default":"Inconsistent configurations between services"},{"k":"s12","type":"s","label":"List item 4","default":"Limited visibility into resource utilisation"},{"k":"s13","type":"s","label":"List item 5","default":"Untested disaster recovery arrangements"},{"k":"s14","type":"s","label":"List item 6","default":"Performance bottlenecks affecting your users"}]}